+## Original reference-shaped kart helmet, 2026-10-25
+
+The owner supplied a white full-face helmet photograph as a shape reference. `game/vehicle/kart_helmet.gd` is original authored geometry following its rounded crown, swept jaw/neck opening and visor arrangement. No source photograph, manufacturer logo or branded asset is included in the game. The 32 new native helmet resources replace 22 earlier resources; all 196 other prepared mesh files remain identical. Current catalogue/news and all 49 livery images are native photographs of the original model. Source hashes, review captures and acceptance limits are in `docs/KART_REFERENCE_HELMET_2026_10_25.md` and `docs/evidence/kart-reference-helmet-2026-10-25/report.json`.
+<!-- /KART-REFERENCE-HELMET-20261025 -->
